---
title: Art
---
<p>Paintings, drawings and crochet, newest first.</p>
{% if collections.art.length == 0 %}
<p>Nothing here yet. An art page is a text file in the <code>art</code> folder with its picture in <code>images</code>; copy <code>templates/art.md</code> to start.</p>
{% endif %}
<div class="art-grid">
{% for a in collections.art %}
  <figure><a href="{{ a.url }}"><img src="{{ a.data.image }}" alt="{{ a.data.title }}"></a><figcaption>{{ a.data.title }}</figcaption></figure>
{% endfor %}
</div>
